WEBVTT

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.120
Now, Woody, he's been my pal
for as long as I can remember.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.920
He's brave, like a cowboy should be.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:19.960
And kind. And smart.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.880
But the thing that makes Woody special
is he'll never give up on you.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.400
Ever.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.960
He'll be there for you, no matter what.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.640
You think you can
take care of him for me?

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.720
Okay then.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.840
Oh, no! Dr. Pork Chop's attacking
the haunted bakery!

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.000
(MIMICS LASERFIRE)

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.320
The ghosts are getting away.
Woody'll stop 'em!

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.960
Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.840
BONNIE: And we'll actually need
the rocket.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.800
ANDY: They're getting away!
Come on, Bullseye!

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:11.880
BONNIE: We need to get in the
spaceship. The volcano is gonna erupt.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.800
Look! They're being attacked
by a real dog!

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.280
ANDY: You can eat
my poisonous scones!

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.520
BONNIE: Mr. and Mrs. Potato Head
are in trouble.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.120
Get on, Woody.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.600
It's my friend Woody.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:27.280
Buzz, hurry!
Get your extra turbo booster.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:46.760
(STARTING ENGINE)

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.240
Thanks, guys.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.840
Look, Mommy.
They're all playing together.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.360
Come on. Let's get some lunch.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.240
So long, partner.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.600
Oh, hey, Buzz. You haven't met
Bonnie's toys yet. Hey, come here.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.400
You're gonna love them.
Buzz, this is Dolly.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.000
New toys!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.640
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.840
Noses.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.680
(CHILDREN CHATTERING NOISILY)

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.440
(CRYING)

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.920
(RINGING)

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.120
(MOUTHING)

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.760
(GURGLING)

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:40.320
WOODY: "So I guess you could say
Sunnyside is sunny once again!

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.840
"Hope to hear from you soon. We're all
super excited about your new home.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.520
"Hugs and kisses to everyone."

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:47.960
Aw!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.840
BUZZ: That Barbie
has some nice handwriting.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:54.040
JESSIE: Uh, Buzz,
Barbie didn't write this.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.600
(BOTH EXCLAIMING)

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:57.880
-Grab the sword!
-I got it!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.120
-Okay, go for the...
-Triple bonus!

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.320
-Watch out!
-We got the cloak of darkness!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:03.120
-Run, run!
-My arms are never long enough!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.040
I'll do it! This is it! This is it!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.160
(ELECTRONIC EXPLOSION)

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.800
-Yes!
-We did it!

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.760
High-five! Hold on.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:11.320
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:14.720
Well, it's official.
You guys made the wall.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:18.480
-WOODY: Oh, look at this!
-Golly bob howdy! That's me!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.880
We're all up here!
Hey, Chuckles, lookin' good.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.280
DOLLY: Yeah, she really got your smile.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.800
ALL: Whee! Whee! Whee!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.480
Oh! Oh! (LAUGHS)

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.040
What the...

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.880
(LAUGHING)

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.720
MR. POTATO HEAD: I told you kids!
Stay out of my butt!

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.240
But soft, what light
through yonder window breaks?

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.920
Romeo, o Romeo,
wherefore art thou Romeo?

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:48.600
Next season, we're doing Cats.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.280
Or might I suggest Hamlet?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:55.240
Yeah. Detached wing.
Cosmetic damage.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.520
Nothing a little duct tape can't fix.

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.680
(FLAMENCO MUSIC PLAYING)

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.280
Huh?

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.120
(EXCLAIMING)

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:08.640
(CHUCKLING)

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.840
I don't know what came over me.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.800
Just go with it, Buzz.

